    "title": "Sparse Autoencoders Reveal Interpretable Features in Single-Cell Foundation Models",
    "citation": "Flavia Pedrocchi et al., 2026",
    "url": "https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/d16ed171b95105fb47be9b69ec568e23205aca04",
    "authors": "Flavia Pedrocchi; Florian Barkmann; A. Joudaki; Valentina Boeva",
